flowchart LR
    Cron["CRE cron trigger<br/>every 5 minutes"] -->|starts| WF["Workflow running in CRE DON"]
    WF -->|checkUpkeep for each target| Targets["Configured target contracts"]
    Targets --> Decision{"upkeepNeeded?"}
    Decision -->|no| End["Finish without transaction"]
    Decision -->|yes| Report["Signed CRE report<br/>for this ready target"]
    Report --> Forwarder["KeystoneForwarder"]
    Forwarder -->|target belongs to Vault 1| Receiver1["Vault 1 AutomationReceiver"]
    Forwarder -->|target belongs to Vault 2| Receiver2["Vault 2 AutomationReceiver"]
    Receiver1 -->|approved performUpkeep| Vault1["Vault 1 automation targets"]
    Receiver2 -->|approved performUpkeep| Vault2["Vault 2 automation targets"]
